      "writtenOn": "2024-09-03T18:32:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does that mean that these compiler flags are being overridden, too?\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/cmake/toolchain-common.cmake;l\u003d46-48;drc\u003da5171b272b59c859ed130160d5d77ea816b0511b\n\nDo you have a link to where these are being overridden in boringssl?",
      "parentUuid": "555c63ea_69de5ab3",
      "revId": "d40c337327f3aea66252f8fde867972e0257bc4d",
